      "Master the three stem-changing vowel shifts (e→i, e→ie, a→ä) affecting ONLY du and er/sie/es forms.",
      "Memorize the two most important irregular verbs: sein (bin/bist/ist/sind/seid/sind) and haben (habe/hast/hat/haben/habt/haben).",
      "What makes German verbs different from English verbs, and how can you avoid the most common conjugation mistakes?",
      "Estimated time: 60 Minutes · Prerequisites: Units 1–5 (Nominative, Articles, Negation)"
    ]
  },
