  "culture": {
    "title": { "en": "Cultural context", "de": "Kultureller Kontext" },
    "body": [
      "⚠️ *Common Trap (Fettnäpfchen): 'Ich lese ein Buch' — not 'Ich lese ein BuchE'. German infinitives end in -en, not -e.*",
      "🧠 *Memory Hook for stem-changes: Think of 'EAT' → 'isst' (e→i) and 'READ' → 'liest' (e→ie). The vowel changes like the meaning changes!*",
      "🇩🇪 *Cultural Insight: Germans value precision. Saying 'Ich kann Deutsch' (I can German) is understood but 'Ich kann Deutsch sprechen' (I can speak German) is correct.*"
    ]
